  "body": "Leasehold site with bach included\r\nLease cost $6000pa\r\n\r\nThis classic 16yo one-bedroom Bach offers a cosy and comfortable space, perfect for two people to enjoy a relaxed holiday lifestyle. \r\n\r\nDesigned for easy comfort, it includes a living area, bathroom, one bedroom, a laundry room, a sunroom with zip openings that lets you enjoy the outdoors while staying sheltered. \r\n\r\nIt’s the perfect spot for weekends away or quiet breaks throughout the year — an affordable and relaxing way to enjoy everything the park has to offer.\r\n\r\nThis unique site spans two avenue frontages with duel parking on both ends of the property.\r\n\r\nBrand new heatpump this year.\r\n\r\nIf interested to view, contact Darrell 02102955778\r\nOpen Home Sat 29th Nov \r\n11.30 till 12.40pm",
